@startuml
title API console - create a named Smurf
actor Operator
participant "API console" as CLI
participant SmurfsApiClient as Client
participant "Smurfs.API catalog endpoint" as API
participant "Server Create.Handler" as Create
Operator -> CLI : Choose Create and enter a name
alt blank name / EOF
  CLI --> Operator : Cancel / exit without a POST
else name supplied
  CLI -> Client : CreateSmurfAsync(name)
  Client -> API : POST /api/smurfs {name}\nAuthorization: Bearer token
  alt validated and committed
    API -> Create : Send Create.Command (other fields default)
    Create -> Create : Validate, generate entity, commit
    Create --> API : Success
    API --> Client : 200
    Client --> CLI : Completed
    CLI --> Operator : Creation confirmation
    ref over CLI : Reload current page (browse workflow)
  else invalid name
    API --> Client : 400 with structured validation feedback
    Client --> CLI : ApiException (400)
    CLI --> Operator : Validation feedback and another name prompt
  else token rejected
    API --> Client : 401
    Client -> Client : Discard token
    Client --> CLI : ApiException (401)
    CLI --> Operator : Login prompt (no automatic resubmission)
  else transport failure / unconfirmed HTTP outcome
    Client --> CLI : Exception
    CLI --> Operator : Check list before trying again (no POST retry)
    ref over CLI : Attempt to reload current page
  end
end
@enduml
